    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(A) para 37(b) the FCA or the PRA - functions under the Building Societies Act 1986` THEN "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the Financial Conduct Authority or the Prudential Regulation Authority to exercise its functions under any of the following— (b) the Building Societies Act 1986 (c. 53);"
