    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(A) para 39 the compensation scheme manager (section 212(1) of the 2000 Act)` THEN "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting a body corporate established in accordance with section 212(1) of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 (compensation scheme manager) to exercise its functions."
