    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(A) para 48 proceedings on an application under section 6, 7 or 8 of the Company Directors Disqualification Act 1986` THEN "A disclosure with a view to the institution of, or otherwise for the purposes of, proceedings on an application under section 6, 7 or 8 of the Company Directors Disqualification Act 1986 (c. 46) (disqualification for unfitness)."
    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(A) para 49(a) Upper Tribunal proceedings about a decision of the Financial Services Authority` THEN "A disclosure with a view to the institution of, or otherwise for the purposes of, proceedings before the Upper Tribunal in respect of— (a) a decision of the Financial Services Authority;"
    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(A) para 49(aa) Upper Tribunal proceedings about a decision of the Prudential Regulation Authority` THEN "A disclosure with a view to the institution of, or otherwise for the purposes of, proceedings before the Upper Tribunal in respect of— (aa) a decision of the Prudential Regulation Authority;"
    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(A) para 49(b) Upper Tribunal proceedings about a decision of the Bank of England` THEN "A disclosure with a view to the institution of, or otherwise for the purposes of, proceedings before the Upper Tribunal in respect of— (b) a decision of the Bank of England; or"
