    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(C) para 6 proceedings on an application under Part XXV of the Companies (Guernsey) Law 2008` THEN "A disclosure with a view to the institution of, or otherwise for the purposes of, proceedings on an application under Part XXV of the Companies (Guernsey) Law 2008 (disqualification orders)."
