    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(D) para 2(a) a person conducting an investigation under section 16 of the Collective Investment Schemes Act 2008` THEN "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting a person conducting an investigation under— (a) section 16 of the Collective Investment Schemes Act 2008 (an Act of Tynwald: c. 7);"
    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(D) para 2(b) a person conducting an investigation under Schedule 2 to the Financial Services Act 2008` THEN "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting a person conducting an investigation under— (b) Schedule 2 to the Financial Services Act 2008 (an Act of Tynwald: c. 8); or"
