    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(D) para 5 the Office of Fair Trading of the Isle of Man - functions under Schedule 4 to the Financial Services Act 2008` THEN "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the Office of Fair Trading of the Isle of Man to exercise its functions under Schedule 4 to the Financial Services Act 2008 (an Act of Tynwald) in relation to a financial services dispute within the meaning of paragraph 1(1) of that Schedule."
    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(D) para 6 an adjudicator appointed under paragraph 4 of Schedule 4 to the Financial Services Act 2008` THEN "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting an adjudicator appointed under paragraph 4 of Schedule 4 to the Financial Services Act 2008 (an Act of Tynwald) to exercise their functions."
    WHEN `sch 2 part 2(D) para 7 the body administering a compensation scheme under section 25 of the Financial Services Act 2008` THEN "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the body administering a scheme under section 25 of the Financial Services Act 2008 (an Act of Tynwald) (compensation schemes) to exercise its functions under the scheme."
