-- src:19248 | (c) “ foreign lawyer ” means a person who has not been admitted as mentioned in paragraph (a) or (b) but is a member, and entitled to practise as such, of a legal profession regulated within a jurisdiction outside Jersey.
@ref sch 2 part 2(B) para 12(2)(c) Foreign lawyer (Jersey) (src:19248)
