      `the person has been admitted to the Bar under the Advocates and Solicitors (Jersey) Law 1997` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a member, and entitled to practise as such, of a legal profession regulated within a jurisdiction outside Jersey` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 2 part 2(B) para 12(2)(c) the person is a foreign lawyer` MEANS
